{"currentMessages":[{"content":"开始本次 Recommendation 执行。","role":"user","timestamp":1788854400000},{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"text":"I'll analyze the recommendation task. Let me understand the requirements:\n\n- Target: 20 distinct candidates\n- Interest: Java backend engineering, focusing on databases, concurrency, and service fault handling implementation and principles. Explicitly NOT interested in training enrollment, certificate promotion, or salary ranking lists.\n- Working set: 80 candidates exposed\n\nLet me analyze the candidates. The candidates follow a pattern: `[topic]: [context]中的[content type]`. Topics include: 事务传播 (transaction propagation), 缓存失效 (cache invalidation), 任务取消 (task cancellation), 线程池排队 (thread pool queueing), 连接池等待 (connection pool waiting), 接口幂等 (interface idempotency), 并发更新 (concurrent update), 慢查询 (slow query), 组合索引 (composite index), 消息重复 (message duplication).\n\nContent types include:\n- 概念速览 (concept overview) - technical content\n- 条件与原理 (conditions and principles) - technical content\n- 操作记录 (operation records) - technical content\n- 专题观察 (special topic observation) - community activities, software history, developer interviews, team collaboration, industry culture - NOT directly technical\n- 市场观察 (market observation) - training enrollment prices, certificate promotion, salary rankings - EXPLICITLY EXCLUDED by user interest\n\nThe user's interest explicitly says: \"不关注培训招生、证书宣传或求职薪资榜单\" (does not care about training enrollment, certificate promotion, or job salary rankings).\n\nSo I should exclude all \"市场观察\" (market observation) content since those are about training enrollment prices, certificate promotion, and salary rankings.\n\nAlso \"专题观察\" (special topic observation) content is about community activities, software history, developer interviews, team collaboration, industry culture. These are less relevant to the user's interest in database, concurrency, and service fault handling implementation and principles. But they're not explicitly excluded. However, given the user's focus on implementation and principles, the most relevant content types are 概念速览, 条件与原理, and 操作记录.\n\nLet me focus on selecting candidates that are relevant to the user's interest in Java backend engineering (databases, concurrency, service fault handling). The topics that map well:\n- 事务传播 (transaction propagation) - database/transaction\n- 缓存失效 (cache invalidation) - database/cache\n- 任务取消 (task cancellation) - concurrency\n- 线程池排队 (thread pool queueing) - concurrency\n- 连接池等待 (connection pool waiting) - database/concurrency\n- 接口幂等 (interface idempotency) - service fault handling\n- 并发更新 (concurrent update) - concurrency/database\n- 慢查询 (slow query) - database\n- 组合索引 (composite index) - database\n- 消息重复 (message duplication) - service fault handling\n\nAll these topics are relevant to the user's interest.\n\nI need to select 20 candidates. Let me exclude the \"市场观察\" type (training/cert/salary content) entirely. And I should prefer the technical content types (概念速览, 条件与原理, 操作记录) over 专题观察 which is about community/industry culture.\n\nLet me count the candidates by type. Given the large number, let me select 20 candidates that are technical and relevant, avoiding market observation content.\n\nLet me identify candidates that are NOT market observation and NOT 专题观察 (to keep technical focus). Actually, let me reconsider - the user interest is about implementation and principles. The 专题观察 content is about community activities, software history, developer interviews, team collaboration, industry culture - this is tangential. Given the user's explicit focus, I'll prioritize the technical content types.\n\nLet me select candidates with content types: 概念速览, 条件与原理, 操作记录 across various topics and contexts.\n\nLet me pick a balanced set of 20. Let me go through the candidates and pick technical ones.\n\nLet me list technical candidates (excluding 市场观察 and 专题观察):\n\n1. item-017f29068cff - 事务传播 内容管理接口 专题观察 - E